  <Fragment slot="lessons">
<li>Draw public routes and private thresholds on the first plan, not as a later sign-making exercise.</li>
<li>Separate shared-flat life from shared-building life; offer different degrees of participation.</li>
<li>Give flexible rooms an operator and a budget. An empty room is potential, not yet a community service.</li>
</Fragment>

  <Fragment slot="sources"><a href="https://fatkoehl.com/wohnenmixed-use/spreefeld-berlin/">fatkoehl · Spreefeld project account</a>. Reviewed October 2026. Approximate counts are identified; population changes over time.</Fragment>
</CaseStudy>
